N2  CONSTRAINT ENTRY: a Lagrange multiplier imposing P = P_cap
======================================================================================================================
  [PASS] N2 P == P_cap gives rho = -P_cap + C1 n (dust + a constant): T_mn = C1 n u u + P_cap g_mn... i.e. Lambda_eff = Lambda (1 - eps): the always-saturated cap only renormalises Lambda
         measured: rho = C1*n - P_c ; Lambda_eff = Lambda*(1 - epsilon) (True); a0 shifts by +0.0022 dex (absorbed in the FITTED kappa)
         reading:  no cap PHYSICS: the constraint entry either binds everywhere (this) or is the unconstrained fluid (multiplier zero, pressure a free function)

